    tr: "Rabbanā wa laka l-hamd, hamdan kathīran tayyiban mubārakan fīh.",
    en: "Our Lord, and to You belongs all praise – abundant, pure and blessed praise. (On rising from bowing; more than thirty angels hastened to record it.)",
