    tr: "Allāhumma laka aslamt, wa bika āmant, wa ʿalayka tawakkalt, wa ilayka anabt, wa bika khāsamt. Allāhumma innī aʿūdhu bi-ʿizzatik, lā ilāha illā ant, an tudillanī, anta l-hayyu lladhī lā yamūt, wal-jinnu wal-insu yamūtūn.",
